  {
   "id": "what-comes-after-143264@major-2021-05-12",
   "gameId": "what-comes-after-143264",
   "displayName": "Bug fixes update for Simplified Chinese",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-05-12T13:11:47.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all, thank you so much for playing What Comes After, your support means so much to us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A few days ago, I was notified by our friend who helped localizing the game to Chinese (thanks 依然爱国足!) that the Chinese version has a bug that made you stuck during the scene with the old tree.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I just want to notify you that we have found and fixed the problem. Simply update your game to the latest version, and you should be able to play the game without much trouble now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're really sorry for the inconvenience, and we hope you have a pleasant journey with Vivi.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
